        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 năm trước",
        "text": "My favourite old house in Hoi An old town. The colour and the design is very unique. It used to be a shop that sold all sort of things from silk to medicine from China. Now there’s a lot of old bowls and cups displayed inside. Worth a visit! Or just standing there and watch the crowd passing by.\n\nWhat’s better is you don’t need a ticket to enter, FREE, and no pushy salesperson soft selling you souvenirs.",
